{"id":"3264193545","kind":"answer","title":"有没有什么事是你坚持很久的，现在还在坚持吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2023-10-25","updated":"2023-10-25","votes":217,"comment_count":15,"minutes":1,"chars":567,"keywords":["间隔重复","检索练习","助记媒介","记忆卡片","随机最短路径"],"summary":"研究人类记忆 2017 年，正值高二的我，为了治疗英语偏科，开始研究怎么背单词，从此拉开我对人类记忆研究的序幕。 2023 年，在墨墨背单词正式工作一年多，发表了三篇对建模人类记忆和优化复习时间的论文： 基于LSTM的语言学习长期记忆预测模型 叶峻峣：KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/625096782/answer/3264193545","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"研究人类记忆"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"sec-1\">研究人类记忆</h2><p data-pid=\"QHJcAFSB\">2017 年，正值高二的我，为了治疗英语偏科，开始研究怎么背单词，从此拉开我对人类记忆研究的序幕。</p><p data-pid=\"RVnovjH1\">2023 年，在墨墨背单词正式工作一年多，发表了三篇对建模人类记忆和优化复习时间的论文：</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-ddca7fc1c27ce46b9d8218f14af5d45e_120x160.jpg\" data-image-height=\"392\" data-image-width=\"279\" href=\"http://jcip.cipsc.org.cn/CN/Y2022/V36/I12/133\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">基于LSTM的语言学习长期记忆预测模型</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-337e676d732039a25471c1057c54bfa3_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1480\" data-image-width=\"2700\" data-tm-id=\"577383961\" href=\"#/post/577383961\">叶峻峣：KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育]</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5285ed3ff6a616b988d261d5e1ec764f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1526\" data-image-width=\"2752\" data-tm-id=\"656714407\" href=\"#/post/656714407\">叶峻峣：IEEE TKDE 2023 | 墨墨背单词：通过捕捉记忆动态，优化间隔重复调度</a><p data-pid=\"og7rpkFQ\">这篇文章介绍了我发表论文的心路历程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-08134e67de67b70a126b02829d90edcc_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1592\" data-image-width=\"2251\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/543325359\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：我是如何在本科期间发表顶会论文的？（内含开源代码和数据集）</a><p data-pid=\"SCjFkCLv\">我现在还在继续这趟研究之旅。为了让更多人能够了解记忆系统的前沿进展，我还成立了 <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"3c9990a12cdbcd92e20b1387b160f0a3\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$3c9990a12cdbcd92e20b1387b160f0a3\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/JarrettYe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组，翻译了很多记忆相关的文章：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-3fc5e91c7a88c26207775c8301afbe1f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"328\" data-image-width=\"1579\" data-tm-id=\"434074509\" href=\"#/post/434074509\">叶峻峣：如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-ef9c32c54c557d5f8b95225ced9fea2e_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"4000\" data-image-width=\"6000\" data-tm-id=\"587991760\" href=\"#/post/587991760\">叶峻峣：构建更好的记忆系统</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-615d25762deff2e17e405df811f4309f_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1891\" data-image-width=\"3875\" data-tm-id=\"653174197\" href=\"#/post/653174197\">叶峻峣：阅读理解与记忆系统</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-c5447d6e556f3ce5539c04157f4c0b68_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"948\" data-image-width=\"1188\" data-tm-id=\"620583957\" href=\"#/post/620583957\">叶峻峣：记忆系统如何帮助解决问题</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-9268cd1d0435215e42750c7d34ecd7b5_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1203\" data-image-width=\"2183\" data-tm-id=\"420105707\" href=\"#/post/420105707\">叶峻峣：(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述</a><p data-pid=\"d5Q9ntZI\">也欢迎大家加入我们汉化组，一起为传播学习技术和教育方法的事业而努力：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-64d6012b3a60ff8fe3220b4bdc3a6bc2_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"2388\" data-image-width=\"3396\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/562739389\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shom：Thoughts Memo 汉化组简介与翻译上手教程</a><p data-pid=\"ok0GRjXZ\">当然，除了坚持做人类记忆相关的研究，我还一直在翻译学校教育批判文集，感兴趣的读者朋友可以看看我的专栏：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5e181f31b379b3be25fbc815f981afa0_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"200\" data-image-width=\"200\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/column/supermemo-guru-cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学校教育</a><p data-pid=\"B7RPrbGa\">还有语言学习方法：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5e181f31b379b3be25fbc815f981afa0_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"200\" data-image-width=\"200\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/column/c_1537015147880669184\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">外语习得</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"434074509","title":"如何写出好卡片：利用间隔重复创造理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":1403,"minutes":55,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"577383961","title":"KDD'22 | 墨墨背单词：基于时序模型与最优控制的记忆算法 [AI+教育]","author":"Junyao Ye","votes":574,"minutes":16,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"656714407","title":"IEEE TKDE 2023 | 墨墨背单词：通过捕捉记忆动态，优化间隔重复调度","author":"Jingyong Su","votes":335,"minutes":23,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"420105707","title":"(1/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——概述","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":310,"minutes":10,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"587991760","title":"构建更好的记忆系统","author":"Michael Nielsen","votes":157,"minutes":14,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"653174197","title":"阅读理解与记忆系统","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":98,"minutes":22,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"594372725","title":"用间隔重复软件记住一门编程语言","author":"Derek Sivers","votes":230,"minutes":8,"reason":"延伸深读 · Derek Sivers"},{"id":"420309917","title":"(2/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之测试效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":170,"minutes":10,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"420924493","title":"(3/5) 高效学习的间隔重复——文献综述之间隔效应","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":95,"minutes":32,"reason":"延伸深读 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"649704369","title":"叶峻峣, 苏敬勇, 曹译珑. 优化间隔重复调度的一种随机最短路径算法[C]//第 28 届 ACM SIGKDD 知识发现与数据挖掘学术会议论文集, 2022: 4381-4390","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":18,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"468172742","title":"间隔重复记忆系统让记忆更加自动化，从而有助于更深入的琢磨思考","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2901234936","title":"ChatGPT 出现后，那些靠知识记忆取胜的教育模式会被颠覆吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":2309,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 2309 赞同"},{"id":"3242193598","title":"一个人能做出什么开源项目？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":217,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 217 赞同"},{"id":"3219552411","title":"为什么感觉艾宾浩斯记忆法不是很有效？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":698,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 698 赞同"},{"id":"2731574667","title":"艾宾浩斯记忆法是否科学？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":239,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 239 赞同"},{"id":"3479685534","title":"墨墨背单词，为什么能让我们更好的记忆单词？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":34,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 34 赞同"}]}